#: src-ru/data/events_engi.xml.rawclobber:299
msgid "data/events_engi.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"ENGI_SURRENDER\"]/text"
msgstr "附近一艘半械族巡洋舰正观察你的到来。看到你全副武装的飞船，它们的舰长立即表示投降：“目标主体：福祉。半械族动机：生存。移交补给可否接受？”"

#: src-ru/data/events_engi.xml.rawclobber:301
msgid ""
"data/events_engi.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"ENGI_SURRENDER\"]/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "向它们解释你是朋友。"

#: src-ru/data/events_engi.xml.rawclobber:305
msgid ""
"data/events_engi.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"ENGI_SURRENDER\"]/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "接受它们的投降提议。"

#: src-ru/data/events_engi.xml.rawclobber:307
msgid ""
"data/events_engi.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"ENGI_SURRENDER\"]/choice[2]/event/text"
msgstr "半械族顺从地转交补给，然后按原航线离开。轻松赚钱。"

#: src-ru/data/events_engi.xml.rawclobber:314
msgid ""
"data/events_engi.xml.rawclobber$//eventList[@name=\"ENGI_SURRENDER_LIST\"]/event[1]/text"
msgstr "半械族似乎放松下来，急于离开。它们飞走了，未道别。"

#: src-ru/data/events_engi.xml.rawclobber:317
msgid ""
"data/events_engi.xml.rawclobber$//eventList[@name=\"ENGI_SURRENDER_LIST\"]/event[2]/text"
msgstr "半械族似乎放松下来，急于离开。它们飞走了，未道别。"

#: src-ru/data/events_engi.xml.rawclobber:320
msgid ""
"data/events_engi.xml.rawclobber$//eventList[@name=\"ENGI_SURRENDER_LIST\"]/event[3]/text"
msgstr "半械族对你的解释感到满意：“有益。主体目标：漫长、漫长的旅程。保留与半械族补给移交的兼容性。”它们自愿向你发送设备，你感觉好多了。"

#: src-ru/data/events_engi.xml.rawclobber:324
msgid ""
"data/events_engi.xml.rawclobber$//eventList[@name=\"ENGI_SURRENDER_LIST\"]/event[4]/text"
msgstr "得知你是为联邦而战，半械族帮你升级了飞船反应堆，还安装了额外的增强部件。"

#: src-ru/data/events_engi.xml.rawclobber:329
msgid ""
"data/events_engi.xml.rawclobber$//eventList[@name=\"ENGI_SURRENDER_LIST\"]/event[5]/text"
msgstr "得知你是为联邦而战，半械族帮你升级了飞船反应堆，还安装了额外的增强部件。"

#: src-ru/data/events_engi.xml.rawclobber:334
msgid ""
"data/events_engi.xml.rawclobber$//eventList[@name=\"ENGI_SURRENDER_LIST\"]/event[6]/text"
msgstr "半械族平静下来，向你的飞船派出一架舰体维修无人机，修复了飞船的损伤。"

#: src-ru/data/events_engi.xml.rawclobber:354
msgid ""
"data/events_engi.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"ENGI_MANTIS_FIGHT\"]/text[1]"
msgstr "雷达上的模糊信号来自一艘螳螂族突击舰，它正在抢劫一艘半械族运输船的残骸。它们调转船头，投入战斗。"

#: src-ru/data/events_engi.xml.rawclobber:355
msgid ""
"data/events_engi.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"ENGI_MANTIS_FIGHT\"]/text[2]"
msgstr "你看到一艘螳螂族劫掠舰正朝一座手无寸铁的半械族补给站胡乱开火。注意到自己的武器对空间站伤害不大后，劫掠者转而盯上你的飞船。战斗！"

#: src-ru/data/events_engi.xml.rawclobber:356
msgid ""
"data/events_engi.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"ENGI_MANTIS_FIGHT\"]/text[3]"
msgstr "这片区域看似安全，你正准备离开，一艘螳螂族侦察船突然跃迁到你身后！它们和你一样惊讶，但它们的武器已经启动了。"

#: src-ru/data/events_engi.xml.rawclobber:357
msgid ""
"data/events_engi.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"ENGI_MANTIS_FIGHT\"]/text[4]"
msgstr "你发现一小队半械族正遭到一艘螳螂族飞船的攻击。半械族设法抵达节点并跃迁离开，留下你独自面对追击者！"

#: src-ru/data/events_engi.xml.rawclobber:361
msgid "data/events_engi.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"ENGI_REBEL_FIGHT\"]/text"
msgstr "这片宇宙区域出现了一艘叛军战舰，表明部分叛军舰队已抵达半械族领地。你发起进攻。"

#: src-ru/data/events_engi.xml.rawclobber:366
msgid "data/events_engi.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"ENGI_PIRATE_FIGHT\"]/text"
msgstr "这里过去大概是海盗的天堂，但随后战争爆发，盗贼的逍遥日子被终结了。迎面飞来的海盗船看起来破旧且满腔怒火。只能战斗了！"

#: src-ru/data/events_engi.xml.rawclobber:379
msgid ""
"data/events_engi.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"ENGI_STATION_DISTRESS\"]/text"
msgstr "你收到附近一艘半械族飞船的求救信号：“请求援助。存在危险。毁灭不可避免。”"

#: src-ru/data/events_engi.xml.rawclobber:381
msgid ""
"data/events_engi.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"ENGI_STATION_DISTRESS\"]/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "回应呼叫并前往救援。"

#: src-ru/data/events_engi.xml.rawclobber:385
msgid ""
"data/events_engi.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"ENGI_STATION_DISTRESS\"]/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "保持距离。"

#: src-ru/data/events_engi.xml.rawclobber:391
msgid ""
"data/events_engi.xml.rawclobber$//eventList[@name=\"ENGI_STATION_DISTRESS_LIST\"]/event[1]/text"
msgstr ""
"你收到来自那艘飞船的另一条信息，屏幕上出现的是一只螳螂：“愚蠢的软体生物！这里除了我们没有别人！”它喊道。传感器显示那艘飞船正进行拦截，同时有入侵者从空间站传送过来。"

#: src-ru/data/events_engi.xml.rawclobber:397
msgid ""
"data/events_engi.xml.rawclobber$//eventList[@name=\"ENGI_STATION_DISTRESS_LIST\"]/event[2]/text"
msgstr "你靠近后发现一艘螳螂族飞船正在攻击一座小型半械族空间站。你准备战斗！"

#: src-ru/data/events_engi.xml.rawclobber:404
msgid ""
"data/events_engi.xml.rawclobber$//eventList[@name=\"SAVE_ENGI_STATION\"]/event[1]/text"
msgstr "半械族空间站已被彻底洗劫，能看出激烈战斗的痕迹。显然，螳螂族故意让求救信号保持开启，以诱捕其他飞船。"

#: src-ru/data/events_engi.xml.rawclobber:407
msgid ""
"data/events_engi.xml.rawclobber$//eventList[@name=\"SAVE_ENGI_STATION\"]/event[2]/text"
msgstr "空间站当时正在疏散。平民半械族感谢你，同时完成离开的准备工作。作为奖励，它们提供了一些燃料。"

#: src-ru/data/events_engi.xml.rawclobber:411
msgid ""
"data/events_engi.xml.rawclobber$//eventList[@name=\"SAVE_ENGI_STATION\"]/event[3]/text"
msgstr "空间站向你致意：“感谢。无援助时被击毁的估算概率……86.2%。请申请适当奖励。”"

#: src-ru/data/events_engi.xml.rawclobber:413
msgid ""
"data/events_engi.xml.rawclobber$//eventList[@name=\"SAVE_ENGI_STATION\"]/event[3]/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "请求燃料。"

#: src-ru/data/events_engi.xml.rawclobber:417
msgid ""
"data/events_engi.xml.rawclobber$//eventList[@name=\"SAVE_ENGI_STATION\"]/event[3]/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "请求武器。"

#: src-ru/data/events_engi.xml.rawclobber:421
msgid ""
"data/events_engi.xml.rawclobber$//eventList[@name=\"SAVE_ENGI_STATION\"]/event[3]/choice[3]/text"
msgstr "请求无人机。"

#: src-ru/data/events_engi.xml.rawclobber:425
